# Root-level alias required by T002.
#
# The .specify scripts (common.sh: get_repo_root) resolve the specs root from
# `git rev-parse --show-toplevel`, which in this repo is THIS directory — not the
# phase directory. To make them resolve, `specs/004-local-kubernetes-deployment`
# is a Windows directory junction pointing at
# phase-4-local-kubernetes-deployment/specs/004-local-kubernetes-deployment.
#
# It must never be committed: git would follow the junction and duplicate that
# feature's files into the repo root. The real files live under the phase directory.
/specs/
